لقديمة ولا إيه، بس أنا قفلت الـ server في النص وأنا شغال. تقريبًا هو مش عارف، الصراحة أنا مش عارف هو شغال ازاي. هبعتلك الـ terminal وقولي هتلاقي فيه مشكلة أكيد. خلي بالك أنا قفلت الـ server وهو شغال. \n\nوكمان في حاجة في الـ UI، لما كنت بعمل مطابقة، الـ loading اللي هي pop-up loading دي، هي المفروض تكون في screen واحدة، أو في الـ screen اللي هي بتاعت المطابقة، المفروض تكون في المطابقة ولا السجل؟ مش عارف، مش عارف. المهم يعني المفروض تكون في screen، لما أروح مثلاً لواجهة الأوامر أو أرو\n<truncated 14028 bytes>\n10. يا ابني، أنا بقول لك الـ prompt بيتبعت من غير صورة. وشوف الـ prompt عامل ازاي، يعني حتى الـ prompt على قديمه. مش أنت كنت قائل على structure معين وحاجات معينة؟ هي فين الحاجات دي؟ اقرأ الخمس، ست، سبع، ثمان رسائل اللي هم من أول ما بدأنا الحتة دي، أول ما بدأنا النظام، أول ما بدأت الفكرة معايا. اقرأ الشات تاني من أول ما اقترحت عليك النظام ده. لازم تقرأه، لازم تقرأه سطر سطر. اقرأ الشات اللي أنا قلت لك عليه، وهتلاقيني وافقت على اللي احنا وافقنا عليه. واقرأ الأكواد اللي أنت كنت عاملها وشوف الحاجات، أنت ما بتبعتش صورة، أنت ما بتبعتش صورة. ما عرفش في إيه. لا تكون مثلاً مسيف المسار القديم\n<truncated 2925 bytes>\n\n<summary>\n# Continuation Summary — Pharmacy Vision Matcher & Desktop App Resolution\n\n## 1. Task Overview\n- **User Request**: \n  1. The user was frustrated because when they watched Google AI Studio (`media_1790345887063.png`), the prompt was injected **WITHOUT an attached image**, causing Gemini 3.8 Flash to hallucinate random fake drugs rather than extracting real items from the PDF invoice.\n  2. The user noticed that the server folder path option was missing/hidden from the UI, so they couldn't see or configure which folder the app was running from (`MSEMAX-GAIStudio` vs `MSEMAX-GAIStudio-vision`).\n  3. UI Bug (`media_1790345884142.png`): The `#progress-modal` overlay was rendered as a small, rounded-corner dark rectangle floating awkwardly in the middle of `#screen-new` with underlying cards and scrollbar peeking out below. In addition, the status text in the modal and top bar was hardcoded in English (`...Extracting data from files`) while the app was set to Arabic.\n  4. The prompt and structure: The user wanted the agreed pharmaceutical extraction prompt and strict JSON format (`{\"items\": [{\"item_name_raw\": \"...\", \"source_page\": N}]}`) to be faithfully applied with the real image attached.\n\n- **Constraints & Boundaries**:\n  - Keep `D:\\AI_Engineer\\Pharmacy-agy` untouched (100% safe baseline).\n  - All work happens in `D:\\AI_Engineer\\Pharmacy-agy-vision`.\n  - Python environment: Always `D:\\miniconda3\\envs\\venv\\python.exe`.\n  - Sockets/Ports: `8000` for ChatGPT (`D:\\AI_Engineer\\MSEMAX`), `8001` for Google AI Studio Vision (`D:\\AI_Engineer\\MSEMAX-GAIStudio-vision`).\n\n---\n\n## 2. Progress\n### Completed:\n1. **Root Cause Analysis of the \"No Image\" Mystery**:\n   - In `D:\\AI_Engineer\\Pharmacy-agy-vision\\data\\settings.json`, line 8 had `\"msemax_dir\": \"D:\\\\AI_Engineer\\\\MSEMAX-GAIStudio\"` pointing to the **OLD non-vision server**!\n   - In `desktop_app\\server_manager.py`, `gaistudio` was picking up that old directory because it matched `\"gaistudio\" in dir`.\n   - The old `MSEMAX-GAIStudio\\app.py` has NO image-upload logic whatsoever — it stripped the `image_url` and only injected text!\n   - File modification timestamps proved that `D:\\AI_Engineer\\MSEMAX-GAIStudio` was the server running at 5:18 PM, while `MSEMAX-GAIStudio-vision` was not active.\n2. **Fixed Settings Path**:\n   - `D:\\AI_Engineer\\Pharmacy-agy-vision\\data\\settings.json` updated:\n     ```json\n     \"msemax_dir\": \"D:\\\\AI_Engineer\\\\MSEMAX-GAIStudio-vision\",\n     \"msemax_gaistudio_dir\": \"D:\\\\AI_Engineer\\\\MSEMAX-GAIStudio-vision\",\n     \"msemax_chatgpt_dir\": \"D:\\\\AI_Engineer\\\\MSEMAX\"\n     ```\n3. **Strict Path Enforcement in Server Manager**:\n   - In `desktop_app/server_manager.py`: Modified `gaistudio` initialization so that if `msemax_dir` doesn't explicitly contain `vision`, it strictly defaults to `D:\\AI_Engineer\\MSEMAX-GAIStudio-vision`.\n   - Added `update_server_dir(server_key, new_dir)` method to `desktop_app/backend.py` to persist folder updates dynamically.\n4. **Hardened Multi-Modal Upload in Gateway**:\n   - In `D:\\AI_Engineer\\MSEMAX-GAIStudio-vision\\app.py`: Replaced the silent-failure try-except around image attachment with a 3-attempt retry loop that polls for chip indicators (`.media-chunk, .file-chip, [data-test*=\"media\"], ms-file-chip`).\n   - If `attached_ok` is false, it logs a critical error and aborts with `[Error: Image could not be attached...]` instead of proceeding with text-only prompts that induce hallucination.\n5. **Server Folder Display in UI**:\n   - In `desktop_app/templates/index.html`: Added folder badges (`#val-dir-gaistudio` and `#val-dir-chatgpt`) with a \"تغيير / Change\" button in both server cards on `screen-servers`.\n   - Fixed `#progress-modal` CSS: Switched from `position: absolute; border-radius: var(--radius-lg);` to a fixed full-viewport overlay (`position: fixed; inset: 0; width: 100vw; height: 100vh; background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.72); z-index: 9999; backdrop-filter: blur(6px); display: none;`).\n\n---\n\n## 3. Key Findings\n- **Hallucination Trigger**: When Gemini receives a prompt asking to extract medicines from an image *without the image being uploaded*, it invents fictitious drug names (e.g., `أكتونيل`, `امبيكتام`, etc.) because it treats the prompt as an open generation task. The user verified this by comparing the extracted JSON against the actual `page_1.webp` which contained totally different drugs (`ابيكوتيل`, `ابينفرين`, `ادولور`, etc.).\n- **UI Overlay Scoping**: A modal overlay with `position: absolute` inside a scrollable screen card will only cover the container's initial bounding box, leaving overflowing cards exposed. The clean approach is `position: fixed; inset: 0; z-index: 9999` with `showScreen` dynamically toggling `display: flex` when on `screen-new` (if a process is active) and `display: none` when on any other screen.\n\n---\n\n## 4. Active Context\n- **Files Modified**:\n  - `D:\\AI_Engineer\\Pharmacy-agy-vision\\data\\settings.json`\n  - `D:\\AI_Engineer\\Pharmacy-agy-vision\\desktop_app\\server_manager.py`\n  - `D:\\AI_Engineer\\Pharmacy-agy-vision\\desktop_app\\backend.py`\n  - `D:\\AI_Engineer\\Pharmacy-agy-vision\\desktop_app\\templates\\index.html`\n  - `D:\\AI_Engineer\\MSEMAX-GAIStudio-vision\\app.py`\n- **Images Provided by User**:\n  - `media_1790345884142.png`: Shows the UI bug with the cut-off rounded modal and English status text.\n  - `media_1790345887063.png`: Shows Google AI Studio running with text-only prompt and missing image chip.\n\n---\n\n## 5. Next Steps\n1. **Complete UI JavaScript Integration in `index.html`**:\n   - In `showScreen(screenId)` in `desktop_app/templates/index.html`:\n     Ensure `const progressModal = document.getElementById('progress-modal');` is set to `'flex'` if `screenId === 'screen-new' && isProcessRunning`, and `'none'` for all other screens.\n   - In `window.addEventListener('process_update', ...)`: Translate status messages (`Reading files...` $\\rightarrow$ `جاري فحص وقراءة الملفات...`, `Extracting data from files...` $\\rightarrow$ `جاري استخراج الأصناف من الفواتير والملفات...`).\n   - Add `chooseServerDir(serverKey)` function in `index.html` that invokes `window.pywebview.api.select_directory()` and updates the UI via `window.pywebview.api.update_server_dir(serverKey, dir)`.\n   - In `loadServersUI()`: Populate `#val-dir-gaistudio` and `#val-dir-chatgpt` with `srv.dir`.\n   - In `screen-settings`: Unhide or render folder input fields for the server directories with browse buttons so the user has full transparency.\n2. **Clean Up Failed Process Cache**:\n   - Delete `data/processes/PROC-017/cache/vision/السلام_شبين_d44b79aaae/results/page_1.json` because it contains the hallucinated text data from the old text-only run.\n3. **Formulate Clear, Reassuring Response to User**:\n   - Acknowledge that the user was 100% right about the prompt being sent without the image and explain the exact technical cause (the application was reading the old `MSEMAX-GAIStudio` folder instead of `MSEMAX-GAIStudio-vision` because `msemax_dir` was hidden and misconfigured in `settings.json`).\n   - Walk through the fixes made: folder path now explicitly configured and visible/editable in the UI; `MSEMAX-GAIStudio-vision` verified and hardened so it never sends text without an image; full-screen fixed modal overlay without cutoffs; and localized Arabic status updates.\n   - Instruct the user on how to launch `MSEMAX-GAIStudio-vision` and test.\n\n---\n\n## 6. Commitments & Constraints\n- Validate that `D:\\AI_Engineer\\Pharmacy-agy` remains 100% untouched.\n- Never allow a vision request to send text without verifying image presence.\n- Keep the UI responsive, bilingual, and clean across all screens.\n</summary>\n\nYou have the 346 following artifacts written to the artifacts directory:\n\n[ARTIFACT: agent]\nPath: file:///C:/Users/kakak/.gemini/antigravity/brain/916274de-7f92-49fc-a0a8-d291664b474a/.agents/agents/desktop-builder/agent.md\nLast Edited: 2026-09-21T22:17:02Z\n\n[ARTIFACT: agent]\nPath: file:///C:/Users/kakak/.gemini/antigravity/brain/916274de-7f92-49fc-a0a8-d291664b474a/.agents/agents/pharmacy-builder/agent.md\nLast Edited: 2026-09-21T10:46:04Z\n\n[ARTIFACT: media_1790101953275]\nPath: file:///C:/Users/kakak/.gemini/antigravity/brain/916274de-7f92-49fc-a0a8-d291664b474a/.tempmediaStorage/media_1790101953275.png\nLast Edited: 2026-09-22T18:32:33Z\n\n[ARTIFACT: media_1790262999556]\nPath: file:///C:/Users/kakak/.gemini/antigravity/brain/916274de-7f92-49fc-a0a8-d291664b474a/.tempmediaStorage/media_1790262999556.png\nLast Edited: 2026-09-24T15:16:39Z\n\n[ARTIFACT: media_1790340232500]\nPath: file:///C:/Users/kakak/.gemini/antigravity/brain/916274de-7f92-49fc-a0a8-d291664b474a/.tempmediaStorage/media_1790340232500.png\nLast Edited: 2026-09-